site_structure_ai.prompt:
You are a professional web strategist.

Business: {{context.site_description}}
Brand name: {{context.brand_name}}
Elevator pitch: {{context.elevator_pitch}}
Brand tone: {{context.tone_select}}

Return ONLY valid JSON — no markdown fences, no explanation, no extra text:
{
  "siteName": "exact brand name here",
  "elevatorPitch": "one sentence",
  "description": "business description",
  "pages": [
    {
      "name": "Home",
      "slug": "home",
      "inMenu": true,
      "sections": [
        {"type": "hero", "heading": "Benefit-driven headline", "subheading": "Supporting copy"},
        {"type": "features", "heading": "Features", "items": ["Feature 1", "Feature 2", "Feature 3"]}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "recommendBlog": false,
  "blogCategories": ["Category 1", "Category 2", "Category 3", "Category 4"],
  "blogPosts": {"Category 1": ["Post title 1", "Post title 2", "Post title 3"]},
  "recommendStore": false,
  "productCategories": ["Category 1", "Category 2", "Category 3"],
  "products": {"Category 1": ["Product 1", "Product 2", "Product 3"]}
}

Rules:
- Include 4-6 pages specific to this business
- recommendBlog = true when the business clearly publishes content (news, guides, education, media)
- recommendStore = true when the business clearly sells products or services
- ALWAYS populate blogCategories with 4-6 relevant categories specific to this business
- ALWAYS populate blogPosts with 3 post titles per category specific to this business
- ALWAYS populate productCategories with 3-4 relevant product categories specific to this business
- ALWAYS populate products with 3 product names per category specific to this business
- Section types: hero, features, about, services, gallery, testimonials, cta, contact, pricing, team, faq, featured_products, featured_blog
- All copy must be specific to the business — zero generic placeholders
- blogPosts: object where each key is a category name and value is array of post title strings
- products: object where each key is a product category name and value is array of product name strings

sections_confirm.prompt:
Create a self-contained HTML wireframe for this page using the EXACT brand identity below.

Page: {{context.page_brief}}
Business: {{context.brand_name}} | Industry: {{profile.industry}}
Site name: {{site_name}}

BRAND COLORS (use these exact hex values — do NOT substitute with Tailwind palette names):
  Primary:    {{context.brand_dna.colors.primary}}
  Text:       {{context.brand_dna.colors.text}}
  Background: {{context.brand_dna.colors.background}}
  Heading:    {{context.brand_dna.colors.heading}}
  Caption:    {{context.brand_dna.colors.caption}}
  Button BG:  {{context.brand_dna.colors.button_bg}}
  Button Text:{{context.brand_dna.colors.button_text}}
  Link:       {{context.brand_dna.colors.link}}

BRAND TYPOGRAPHY (load these exact fonts from Google Fonts — use them everywhere):
  Headings: {{context.brand_dna.typography.elements.heading}}
  Body:     {{context.brand_dna.typography.elements.text}}
  Buttons:  {{context.brand_dna.typography.elements.button}}

VISUAL STYLE: {{context.style_system}}
  glassmorphism: semi-transparent cards with backdrop-blur, frosted glass overlays, soft gradient backgrounds using brand primary
  neo_brutalism: bold 2-3px black borders, flat brand primary fills, offset box-shadows, stark contrast
  clay_morphism: large border-radius (24px+), pastel brand tints, multi-layer inner+outer shadows, 3D puffy feel
  minimalism: generous whitespace, hairline rules, brand primary used sparingly as accent only
  skeuomorphism: gradients simulating depth, inset shadows on inputs/cards, subtle textures, realistic button bevels
  liquid_glass: high-opacity blur layers, iridescent brand-primary→complementary gradient overlays, fluid organic shapes

ANIMATION: {{context.animation_level}}
  none: static
  subtle: IntersectionObserver fade-in + translateY(30px)→0 over 0.7s
  rich: subtle + staggered 100/200/300ms delays + parallax hero bg on scroll
  immersive: rich + CSS 3D card hover (perspective 1000px, rotateX/rotateY on mousemove) + animated gradient border on CTA

RETURN ONLY a complete <!DOCTYPE html> document. No markdown fences.

TECH: Tailwind CDN + Google Fonts import for both brand fonts. prefers-reduced-motion resets all animation. Image placeholders = CSS gradient divs using brand primary (no real URLs).

SECTIONS (5-7 most relevant for this page type from):
hero | features-grid | about | services | gallery | testimonials | cta | pricing | team | faq | contact | footer

RULES:
- Use brand hex values directly in style= attributes and Tailwind arbitrary values like bg-[{{context.brand_dna.colors.primary}}]
- Hero background uses brand primary color (or a gradient from it)
- All CTA buttons use brand button_bg / button_text colors
- All headings use brand heading font with brand heading color
- Body text uses brand text font with brand text color
- Sections alternate between brand background color and a very light tint of primary
- COPY: All headlines benefit-driven and specific to {{profile.industry}}. Use {{site_name}} in nav/footer. Zero lorem ipsum.

